    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.trailspace\n\n### Description\n\nConsider this set of commands:\r\n\r\n```\r\nhighlight ExtraWhitespace ctermbg=red guibg=red\r\nau BufEnter * match ExtraWhitespace /\\s\\+$/\r\nau InsertEnter * match ExtraWhitespace /\\s\\+\\%#\\@<!$/\r\nau InsertLeave * match ExtraWhiteSpace /\\s\\+$/\r\n```\r\n\r\nThey will highlight trailspace\r\n1. normal mode\r\n2. insert mode, when cursor is not at the end of trailspace\r\n\r\nI like this behavior and hope you can consider modifying the behavior of mini.trailspace",
